                        <p class="font-mono text-sm text-primary">/image_to_frutjam</p>
                        <h3 class="heading-sm">Screenshot → Frutjam</h3>
                        <p class="para text-sm">Describe a UI screenshot or share an image URL. Cherry reproduces it with the closest Frutjam components.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
