                        <div class="card-content flex flex-col gap-2">
                        <p class="font-mono text-sm text-primary">/tailwind_to_frutjam</p>
                        <h3 class="heading-sm">Tailwind → Frutjam</h3>
                        <p class="para text-sm">Paste raw Tailwind HTML. Cherry replaces hand-crafted utilities with the correct Frutjam component classes.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card card-outline">
                        <div class="card-content flex flex-col gap-2">
                        <p class="font-mono text-sm text-primary">/bootstrap_to_frutjam</p>
