                            <pre class="bg-base-200 rounded-lg p-4 text-sm overflow-x-auto mb-5"><code>claude mcp add frutjam-cherry -- npx -y frutjam-cherry@latest</code></pre>
                            <p class="para text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Pro / Team <span class="badge badge-primary badge-soft badge-sm">license required</span></p>
